    "detailed_description": "<h1>Early Access</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As of 1/16/2025 This game\u2019s development has been suspended indefinitely</strong><br><br>After 11 content, gameplay improvement, and performance improvement updates, we have exhausted our financial runway and sales are insufficient to support the cost of operation for the studio, so the game\u2019s development has been suspended indefinitely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has been an exciting but difficult journey full of many surprises (good and bad) and challenges leading us to this point. Although we are saddened that <strong>INFEST</strong>STATION was never able to grow into the game it was meant to be, I am extremely proud of what we were able to accomplish with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are eternally grateful to everyone who has supported Atom Switch and <strong>INFEST</strong>STATION, which will remain available in Early Access (with a heavily reduced price to reflect the situation), in the event that it can one day be revived and completed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More information can be found in the most recent update post on this store page.</p></p><br><h1>Join Us On Discord</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601730/extras/cc831dd8c63116222727729b5639a3bc.avif?t=1737128960\" width=612 height=170 /></span><br>Join us on the Atom Switch Community Discord Server! Check out the sidebar for the link.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601730/extras/bd687f5b9dfc3bf1d5c25e7c57a89e73.avif?t=1737128960\" width=592 height=184 /></span><br><br>In this dystopian future world, players take on the role of <strong>OMICRON</strong>IX Corp Recovery technicians sent out to derelict space stations to resolve the interdimensional catastrophes caused by the Faster-Than-Light Crimson Engine drives.<br><br>Threatened by otherworldly malevolent forces, players must work together to survive the horrors stalking them as they seek to sever this interdimensional rift and disable the <i>Crimson Drive Cores</i> once and for all.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601730/extras/e2dff3c25d4f751089fe8c88ca0f6c52.avif?t=1737128960\" width=612 height=84 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You've Been Hired to the Recovery Corps!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601730/extras/d78e0e2f12fbe50eed3ee1a63fc9189c.poster.avif?t=1737128960\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601730/extras/d78e0e2f12fbe50eed3ee1a63fc9189c.webm?t=1737128960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601730/extras/d78e0e2f12fbe50eed3ee1a63fc9189c.mp4?t=1737128960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><li><strong>Session-based Multiplayer PvE</strong><br>Join up with up to 3 of your friends to board deadly derelict space craft, disable and retrieve the craft's <strong>Crimson Core</strong>, and make it out alive!<br>\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601730/extras/e3d6758793cd2bea757ebd4cd6612967.poster.avif?t=1737128960\" width=418 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601730/extras/e3d6758793cd2bea757ebd4cd6612967.webm?t=1737128960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601730/extras/e3d6758793cd2bea757ebd4cd6612967.mp4?t=1737128960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li><strong>Follow OCIX Procedure</strong><br>Find and Close Crimson Rips | Expand Your Toolset | Extract The Crimson Core | Get OUT Alive!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601730/extras/01da241deacfda15888cd9ef96cd1a67.poster.avif?t=1737128960\" width=516 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601730/extras/01da241deacfda15888cd9ef96cd1a67.webm?t=1737128960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601730/extras/01da241deacfda15888cd9ef96cd1a67.mp4?t=1737128960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li><strong>Stay Alert, Stay Alive</strong><br>Keep your head on a swivel and use all of the tools at your disposal - including those scavenged as you explore - to stay alert to danger as you navigate each derelict space station in search of Crimson Rips to close and the Crimson Drive Core to bring back to your docked dropship, the POD.<br>\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601730/extras/2c1e3e94a7e448f4702895eae4328eb3.poster.avif?t=1737128960\" width=310 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601730/extras/2c1e3e94a7e448f4702895eae4328eb3.webm?t=1737128960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601730/extras/2c1e3e94a7e448f4702895eae4328eb3.mp4?t=1737128960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601730/extras/7f70781e52858a95ba3ef1de9067bf99.avif?t=1737128960\" width=600 height=189 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Backstory</strong></h2><br>50 years have passed since the megacorporation <strong>OMICRON</strong>IX discovered a new technology that could send ships to distant stars in an instant. This FTL Engine was called The Crimson Drive. For decades, <strong>OMICRON</strong>IX recruited the hopeful and the destitute, launching them into the darkest parts of space to mine asteroids and distant planets.<br><br><i>One By One they All Went Dark.</i><br><br>Powered by unexplained and misunderstood forces, extended operation of the Crimson Drives shattered the boundaries of our dimension, creating a gateway to horror on each ship that used it. The things that crossed over have infested the now-derelict crafts, melding them into nests and hives. While the former crew members and their families are now gone, the dangers of these rifts still remain.<br><br>Desperate to reclaim the data recorded during these events, <strong>OMICRON</strong>IX now tasks their downtrodden workforce with returning to these craft, shutting down the dimensional rifts, and returning with the drive\u2019s Crimson Cores for study.<br><br><i>It\u2019s not easy, and it\u2019s not safe. But someone has to do it\u2026</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601730/extras/2f1e39ffd024b84e165c9622b83644fe.avif?t=1737128960\" width=568 height=892 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601730/extras/bd687f5b9dfc3bf1d5c25e7c57a89e73.avif?t=1737128960\" width=592 height=184 /></span><br><br>In this dystopian future world, players take on the role of <strong>OMICRON</strong>IX Corp Recovery technicians sent out to derelict space stations to resolve the interdimensional catastrophes caused by the Faster-Than-Light Crimson Engine drives.<br><br>Threatened by otherworldly malevolent forces, players must work together to survive the horrors stalking them as they seek to sever this interdimensional rift and disable the <i>Crimson Drive Cores</i> once and for all.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601730/extras/e2dff3c25d4f751089fe8c88ca0f6c52.avif?t=1737128960\" width=612 height=84 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You've Been Hired to the Recovery Corps!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601730/extras/d78e0e2f12fbe50eed3ee1a63fc9189c.poster.avif?t=1737128960\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601730/extras/d78e0e2f12fbe50eed3ee1a63fc9189c.webm?t=1737128960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601730/extras/d78e0e2f12fbe50eed3ee1a63fc9189c.mp4?t=1737128960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><li><strong>Session-based Multiplayer PvE</strong><br>Join up with up to 3 of your friends to board deadly derelict space craft, disable and retrieve the craft's <strong>Crimson Core</strong>, and make it out alive!<br>\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601730/extras/e3d6758793cd2bea757ebd4cd6612967.poster.avif?t=1737128960\" width=418 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601730/extras/e3d6758793cd2bea757ebd4cd6612967.webm?t=1737128960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601730/extras/e3d6758793cd2bea757ebd4cd6612967.mp4?t=1737128960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li><strong>Follow OCIX Procedure</strong><br>Find and Close Crimson Rips | Expand Your Toolset | Extract The Crimson Core | Get OUT Alive!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601730/extras/01da241deacfda15888cd9ef96cd1a67.poster.avif?t=1737128960\" width=516 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601730/extras/01da241deacfda15888cd9ef96cd1a67.webm?t=1737128960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601730/extras/01da241deacfda15888cd9ef96cd1a67.mp4?t=1737128960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li><strong>Stay Alert, Stay Alive</strong><br>Keep your head on a swivel and use all of the tools at your disposal - including those scavenged as you explore - to stay alert to danger as you navigate each derelict space station in search of Crimson Rips to close and the Crimson Drive Core to bring back to your docked dropship, the POD.<br>\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601730/extras/2c1e3e94a7e448f4702895eae4328eb3.poster.avif?t=1737128960\" width=310 height=174 >